    },
    "Download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download a model in Settings, under Transcription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téléchargez un modèle dans les réglages, onglet Transcription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Téléchargé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each call is saved as an audio file, with the transcript next to it when transcription is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque appel est sauvegardé dans un fichier audio, avec sa transcription à côté quand elle est activée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything stays on this Mac: the audio and the transcript never leave it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout reste sur ce Mac : l’audio et la transcription n’en sortent jamais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast (base)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rapide (base)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish Setting Up Tiro…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terminer la configuration de Tiro…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If no prompt appeared, turn on Tiro in Privacy & Security, Screen & System Audio Recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si aucune demande ne s’est affichée, activez Tiro dans Confidentialité et sécurité, rubrique Enregistrement de l’écran et de l’audio du système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In many countries, including France, everyone on a call must agree to be recorded. Tell them at the start of the call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans de nombreux pays, dont la France, chaque personne présente sur un appel doit accepter d’être enregistrée. Prévenez-les au début de l’appel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Larger models are more accurate and slower. A model is downloaded only when you ask for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les grands modèles sont plus précis, mais plus lents. Un modèle n’est téléchargé que lorsque vous le demandez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Log file": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichier journal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MIT License": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Licence MIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is off, so only the other side is recorded. Turn on Tiro in Privacy & Security, Microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'accès au micro est coupé : seuls les autres participants sont enregistrés. Activez Tiro dans Confidentialité et sécurité, Microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is off. Turn on Tiro in Privacy & Security, Microphone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’accès au micro est désactivé. Activez Tiro dans Confidentialité et sécurité, rubrique Micro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Micro autorisé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model file": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichier du modèle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Models": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Named after Tiro, Cicero's secretary, who sat in on every speech and invented a shorthand to keep up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiro doit son nom à Tiron, le secrétaire de Cicéron : il assistait à chaque discours et inventa une écriture abrégée pour suivre le rythme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No transcription model": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun modèle de transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun"
          }
        }
